## Interface: 16001
## Title: Evertally - Map
## Group: Evertally
## Category: Evertally
## Notes: Evertally inside OpenMap: gathering places, live players, meets, pings and navigation on the map and the minimap. Needs OpenMap; loads only when you turn it on in Evertally settings.
## Notes-csCZ: Evertally uvnitř OpenMap: místa sbírání, živí hráči, srazy, pingy a navigace na mapě a minimapě. Potřebuje OpenMap; načte se jen po zapnutí v nastavení Evertally.
## Author: Evertally contributors
## Version: 0.11.17
## Dependencies: Evertally
## OptionalDeps: OpenMap, QuestieDB
## LoadOnDemand: 1
